     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\" lang=\"DE-CH\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nDear all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Here are two vacancies (one post-doc and one PhD) that may be of interest to you. The successful candidates will be based at the Vogelwarte Sempach and will be supervised by myself and Marc Kéry.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">For more details about the Post-Doc position see here: <a href=\"https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5612&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448867444000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZPePhzORxl8XiyXaZGSqv\">\r\nhttps://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5612</a> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">For more details about the PhD position see here: <a href=\"https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5492\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5492&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448867444000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hqGKgkfeCboT5n_qIysg-\">\r\nhttps://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5492</a> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Attached are also pdfs with descriptions of both.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Thank you for spreading!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Kind regards</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Michael</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n<span>Michael Schaub<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n<span><span style=\"color:black\">Leiter Bereich &quot;Populationsbiologie&quot;</span><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n<span>Dozent an der Universität Bern<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Tel. </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"tel:+41%2041%20462%2097%2066\" value=\"+41414629766\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">++41 41 462 97 66</a></span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt\" lang=